            <ArticleTitle>The value of thorough assessment in the management of cancer pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>446-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The number of patients likely to require management of cancer pain is increasing. However, although modern analgesia can help most patients achieve complete pain relief, some studies report widespread under-treatment of all types of pain. This paper describes approaches that health professionals can employ to ensure optimum pain management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
